  "prefLabel": "Env-Or 701.02 Applicability",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Or 701.02 Applicability. This chapter shall apply to any individual or entity that engages in any activity for which RSA 485-C:13 requires a groundwater release detection permit.\n\nSource. #8812, eff 2-1-07; ss by #10832, eff 6-1-15; ss by #14420, eff 11-4-25, EXPIRES: 11-4-35",
